    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Alaska",
      "Step aboard one of our Boeing 727-200 jets\nand enjoy our Gold Coast Service and the\nfriendly spirit of our people. You'll know why\nwe say-when you fly Alaska Airlines, you\n\"fly with a happy face.\nWe regret a thorough search of our\nfacilities has failed to locate the\narticle you reported missing.\nWe will continue to keep your file\nopen, and should the item be re-\nturned to us or otherwise recovered,\nit will be promptly forwarded to you.\nThank you for flying Alaska Airlines.\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\nADDRESS\n166\n0016"
    ],
